#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:114
#: a9f5f15d282e412d87a16051a19ec10c
msgid ""
"Locale using coma as decimal separator `crashes qubesd <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/3753>`__. Either install with different locale "
"(English (United States) for example), or manually apply fix explained in "
"that issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:116
#: e29a0c32ca7e46e18daad580c6225612
msgid ""
"In the middle of installation, `keyboard layout reset to US <https://github."
"com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/3352>`__. Be careful what is the current "
"layout while setting default user password (see upper right screen corner)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:118
#: 4e8eb7d0ac894deda2a9252ee1ed2651
msgid ""
