#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:146
#: 85fefa8d40f448218a31469eed6f60d9
msgid ""
"There is no in-place upgrade path from earlier Qubes versions. The only "
"supported option to upgrade to Qubes R4.0 is to install it from scratch and "
"use :doc:`qubes backup and restore tools </user/how-to-guides/how-to-back-up-"
"restore-and-migrate>` for migrating of all of the user VMs. We also provide :"
"doc:`detailed instruction </user/downloading-installing-upgrading/"
"upgrade/4_0>` for this procedure."
msgstr ""
